{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fec87698-ff32-8246-8569-14180d93c236",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:05:56-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nadia Goldberg",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:03:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:03:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. I'm calling about the storm drain at the corner by my house. It's full right to the top and it is not draining at all. Not a bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:03:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. Can I get the address where you're seeing that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:03:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "390 Washington Street, down in the Point. The drain is on the corner, right at the end of my property."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:04:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 390 Washington Street, in the Point. And you said the drain is completely full, water sitting up at the grate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:04:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Up over the grate, practically into the street. That nor'easter was Friday into Saturday, and it's Tuesday now. Three days. It should have gone down by now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:04:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so it's been standing since the storm. Is it just in the street, or is it coming toward any houses?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:04:26-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the street so far and my walkway edge. But my neighbor tells me it happens every big rain. Every one. So it's not a surprise to anybody, is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:04:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'll put it in as a drain not clearing, full to the top, at the corner by 390 Washington. Is that a corner with a cross street, or is it just the bend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:04:48-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a corner, Mrs. Medeiros. Well, I believe it's Miss, I'm sorry, I didn't catch. Anyway, it's a corner, yes. Not a bend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:04:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lorraine is fine. Corner, got it. I'll send it to the crew that handles drains."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:05:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Now, do the crews work weekends? Because if nobody's coming till Monday I would like to know that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:05:09-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After a storm they're usually stretched pretty thin, and they do have to work through a list. I can't tell you the exact day they'll get to yours, but I'm marking it so they know it's been standing since Saturday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:05:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. Well. I used to work in an office with a phone system just like this, where everything got logged and nothing got done. So forgive me if I'm skeptical."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:05:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair. Can I get a number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:05:38-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0176."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:05:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0176. And that's Nadia Goldberg?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:05:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goldberg, with a G-O-L-D. Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:05:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Goldberg. It's logged. If it's still full in a couple of days, call us back and we'll follow up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:05:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Believe me, I will. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
